// Windows resource script for scene-editor.exe.
//
// Ships a single ICON resource so Explorer, the taskbar, Alt-Tab, and
// the Window's own title bar all pick up the teal cube instead of the
// default blank .exe icon. The Windows loader chooses "the first ICON
// resource by name/id" for the exe file icon, so the resource id has
// to sort before any other icon we might add later -- "IDI_APP" is
// conventional and stringy IDs sort lexicographically ahead of numeric
// ones.

IDI_APP ICON "scene-editor.ico"
